  "title": "Chak Now",
  "text": "Products\nShop on Anand\nAbout Us\nContact\nENQUIRE NOW\n#ExpressTicketToSnacking\nTaste of Home,\nWherever You Roam!\n\nIntroducing Chak Now by Anand\nA delightful fusion of tradition and innovation! Anand’s 35 years of expertise of the making the most premium quality sweets and savouries combined with years of R&D by India's finest chefs and consultants, Chaknow is an ode to modern snacking, capturing the essence of South Indian delights. Each bite is authentically fresh and irresistibly tasty. Chak Now!\nChaknow Product Range\nRice Kodubale\n\nAvailable in Rs. 55 pack\n\nPineapple Soan Papdi\n\nAvailable in Rs. 70 pack\n\nMadras Mixture\n\nAvailable in Rs. 55 pack\n\nOrange Soan Papdi\n\nAvailable in Rs. 70 pack\n\nRasgulla Cup\n\nAvailable in Rs. 40 pack\n\nButter Murukku\n\nAvailable in Rs. 55 pack\n\nSoan Papdi\n\nAvailable in Rs. 70 pack\n\nTangy Peanuts\n\nAvailable in Rs. 55 pack\n\nGulab Jamun Tin\n\nAvailable in Rs. 80 Tin\n\nRasgulla Tin\n\nAvailable in Rs. 80 Tin\n\nGulab Jamun Cup\n\nAvailable in Rs. 40 pack\n\nKhara Boondi\n\nAvailable in Rs. 55 pack\n\nVIEW ALL\nAbout Anand\nEstablished in 1988, Anand is a leader in the premium Indian sweets & savories category in India. The brand operates 15 stores and 10 restaurants in Bengaluru. Airport retail stores at Kochi domestic, Kochi International, Bangalore Airport T1, Bangalore Airport T2, Ahmedabad Domestic, Ahmedabad International, Port Blair along with 10 online channels across the country.\nBusiness Format\nAnand operates across both online and offline channels across India.\nRetail Boutique Outlets\n\nAnand’s State of art retail stores spread across Bangalore offers the most premium retailing & dining experience in the industry.\n\nTravel Retail Experience\n\nA special edition collection from the House of Anand, exclusively crafted as a travel retail brand for airports.\n\nMinimal Human Contact\n\nProfessional Chefs\n\n1,40,000 sqft\n\nStaff 1000+\n\n70 Tonnes\n\nAutomated Machineries\n\nOur Certifications\nBenefits of Association\n\nThe strongest and most experienced sweets & savories brand in India\n\nDedicated factory to produce quality products.\n\nEnjoy best-in-class and competitive margins, for a win-win partnership.\n\nStrong and consistent marketing activities, ensuring brand recall therefore maximizing revenue.\n\nVast and growing portfolio ensuring long term profitability and growth\n\nDedicated on-ground sales staff offering 24x7 support to distributors and retail partners\n\nContact Us to Get Associated\n\nWhere passion meets precision, creating culinary magic\n\nWrite to us at: Care@chaknow.com\n\nSUBMIT\n© 2023 Copyright. Chak Now. All Rights Reserved",
